## Step 7: AUTO-CONTINUE (MANDATORY — do NOT skip, do NOT ask)
This step makes startup → continue AUTOMATIC. Execute it every time.

1. **Re-read THIS chat's per-agent handoff now** — do NOT read the legacy singular `H:/prism/state/HANDOFF.md` (it's shared across all 6+ concurrent chats and gets clobbered).

   **Use YOUR session ID** (from the chat bus "You are `claude-XXXXXXXX`"):

   ```bash
